      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "19 expected hosts: 9 Indigo nodes, 8 supporting NixOS VMs, Proxmox and OPNsense. Inventory is explicit; update it when adding hosts. Linux memory panels exclude OPNsense. Systemd covers only configured NixOS units, not every service. No data means missing telemetry, not healthy. DNS internals and application-level coverage follow later."
